---
import Base from '@/templates/Base.astro';
---

<Base head={{ title: 'About | WeiKnight', description: 'About WeiKnight and this personal knowledge archive.' }} theme='real'>
  <main class='mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-5 py-12 font-formal-sans text-real-text sm:py-16'>
    <a href='/' class='text-sm text-real-accent hover:underline'>← Home</a>
    <article class='prose prose-base prose-invert prose-slate mt-10 max-w-none prose-headings:font-black prose-a:text-real-accent prose-strong:text-white md:prose-lg'>
      <h1>About WeiKnight</h1>
      <p>Welcome to my digital den. I am a wolf programmer with a passion for code, systems, and lifelong learning.</p>
      <p>This site collects my technical notes, projects, writing, and discoveries. The Notes area is organized as a directory-based knowledge archive so related subjects stay together and remain easy to browse.</p>
      <p>Whether you are a fellow furry, a curious human, or simply wandering through the forest of knowledge, you are welcome to explore. Constructive feedback is always appreciated.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>You can reach me at <a href='mailto:weiknight0@outlook.com'>weiknight0@outlook.com</a> or follow my work on <a href='https://www.github.com/weiknight0'>GitHub</a>.</p>
      <p>Thanks for visiting. May your learning journey be wild and rewarding. 🐾</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
